                    "line": 112,
                    "blocks": [
                      {
                        "type": "list",
                        "line": 113,
                        "ordered": false,
                        "items": [
                          {
                            "text": "Description:\nExploration of current trends, reform movements, and policy debates influencing curriculum and instructional practice in K-12 education.",
